<!--
    PUF France Use Case 13: Subcontracting with Direct Payment / Payment Delegation
    (Sous-traitance avec paiement direct / délégation de paiement - marchés privés de travaux B2B)

    Reference: XP Z12-014 Annexe A, Section 3.2.12.3 - Cas n°13

    Business Scenario (Invoice F1):
    - A SUBCONTRACTOR (SOUS-TRAITANT) invoices the MAIN CONTRACTOR (TITULAIRE / entreprise
      principale) for works performed on a private construction market.
    - Payment is made directly to the SUBCONTRACTOR by the FINAL BUYER (maître d'ouvrage /
      acheteur final) acting as third-party PAYER, under payment delegation
      (Article 14 of Law n°75-1334 of 31 December 1975).
    - This is the F1 invoice. The MAIN CONTRACTOR separately issues the F2 invoice to the
      FINAL BUYER for the total works (own services + subcontracted).

    Key Requirements:
    - Business process BT-23 = S5: "Dépôt par un sous-traitant d'une facture de prestation de
      service avec paiement direct (avec validation tacite)". (S1 is also permitted by the spec;
      S5 is the subcontractor-specific code and the correct choice when direct payment applies.)
      NOTE: S6 (co-contractor) belongs to Use Case 14 (co-traitance), NOT this case.
    - BG-4 SELLER  = SUBCONTRACTOR (SOUS-TRAITANT)
    - BG-7 BUYER   = MAIN CONTRACTOR (TITULAIRE / entreprise principale)
    - EXT-FR-FE-BG-02 PAYEUR = FINAL BUYER (maître d'ouvrage), third-party payer (role code PR)
    - VAT reverse charge (autoliquidation) applies to construction subcontracting:
      BT-118 = AE, BT-110 = 0, BT-121 = VATEX-FR-AE, BT-120 = AUTOLIQUIDATION
      (CGI art. 283-2 nonies - the MAIN CONTRACTOR self-assesses the VAT)
    - BT-11 Project reference carries the construction site (chantier) for grouping with other
      subcontractor invoices toward the FINAL BUYER.

    Worked figures (per spec illustration, F1 autoliquidated):
    - Total HT (BT-109)  = 25 000.00 EUR
    - Total VAT (BT-110) = 0.00 EUR (autoliquidation)
    - Total TTC (BT-112) = 25 000.00 EUR

    French Text Codes (BT-21/BT-22):
    - #REG#: Company legal form and share capital
    - #ABL#: Trade register number (RCS)
    - #AAI#: Subcontracting / direct payment / autoliquidation explanation
    - #PMD#: Late payment penalties
    - #PMT#: Fixed collection costs indemnity (40 EUR)
    - #BAR#: Treatment type (B2B)
    - #PAI#: Third-party (direct) payment information
-->
